Notebook[{
Cell["\<\
Regularizing the noise so NDSolve can integrate it: a continuously measured \
qubit's trajectory\
\>", "Title",ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A companion to ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox["Trajectories, the Record, and the Master Equation", "TI",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[" and a sequel to ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox["NDSolve/WhenEvent vs ItoProcess", "TI",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 StyleBox[". There we admitted that ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],
 StyleBox[" has no native Wiener input and hand-rolled Euler-Maruyama inside \
a ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["WhenEvent"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],
 StyleBox[". Here we take the other road: make the noise smooth, so the \
stochastic differential equation becomes an ordinary differential equation \
with a wiggly time-dependent forcing that ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],
 StyleBox[" already knows how to integrate. The equation has two readings, It\
\[OHat] and Stratonovich, that differ by one exact drift term; a smooth noise \
integrates to the Stratonovich reading, so the correct route feeds ",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,
  FontWeight->"Bold",ExpressionUUID->"25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],
 StyleBox[" the It\[OHat] drift minus that term. This document writes both \
forms out in full, builds the corrected route from primitives, and measures \
what it buys: it keeps the state in the Bloch ball, reproduces the ensemble \
mean and second moment, and beats the hand-rolled scheme wherever the drive \
is stiff.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"]
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],

Cell["Mads Bahrami (last updated: August 8, 2026)", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],

Cell["\<\
The trajectory equations: state and readout, in It\[OHat] and Stratonovich \
form\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Continuous measurement produces two coupled stochastic equations driven by \
the same noise: one for the observer's running estimate of the state, one for \
the readout the detector writes down. In the most generic diffusive \
(homodyne) form, the conditional state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],
 " obeys a stochastic master equation, and each monitored channel emits a \
current:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
    StyleBox["(",
     FontSize->1.8 Inherited], "-", 
    FractionBox[
     StyleBox["i", "TI"], "\[HBar]"], 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], ",", 
     StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->False], "\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     FontSize->1.8 Inherited], 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", "+", "\[ThickSpace]", 
    UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"],
     LimitsPositioning->False], "\[ScriptCapitalH]", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
     StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], ",", 
   "\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\[NonBreakingSpace]\
\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["Q", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}], "=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SqrtBox[
       SubscriptBox[
        StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["k", "TI"]]], " ", 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
        SpanMaxSize->1,
        FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "+", 
        SubsuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["k", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"]}], 
       StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
        SpanMaxSize->1,
        FontSize->1.2 Inherited]}], " ", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], "+", 
     RowBox[{
      StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
      SubscriptBox[
       StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}]}]}], ","}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "with the dissipator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"\|01d49f", 
    StyleBox["[",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
    StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], "-", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], "{", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    StyleBox["L", "TI"]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],
 " and the measurement (innovation) superoperator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalH]", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "+", 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], "-", 
   StyleBox["Tr",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "+", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"]}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],
 ". The one link that matters: the ",
 StyleBox["same", "TI"],
 " increment ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],
 " drives both equations, so the noise in the record is the noise that kicks \
the state. Here ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["H", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],
 " is the Hamiltonian, the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["L", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],
 " are the Lindblad operators (dissipation), the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"],
 " are the measured operators, the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["k", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],
 " are the detector efficiencies with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],
 ", and the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],
 " are independent Wiener increments with zero mean and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["j", "TI"]], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Delta]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"j", "k"}], "TI"]], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Specialize to our qubit: a Rabi drive ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["H", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "2"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"],
 ", relaxation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], "-"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"],
 ", dephasing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   FractionBox[
    RowBox[{
     SubscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
      StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "+", 
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}], "2"], "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"],
 ", and one homodyne channel measuring ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],
 " through ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], "-", 
    StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
    SqrtBox[
     SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
      StyleBox[
       RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"],
 ". Because ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "+", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[Dagger]"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"],
 ", the record reads out ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "=", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],
 ". Writing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["I", "TI"], "+", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "+", 
    StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["y", "TI"]], "+", 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"],
 " collapses the operator equation onto the Bloch vector ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]}], ",", 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "}", "=", "{", 
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["y", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    SubscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
     StyleBox["z", "TI"]], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"],
 " and the current onto one scalar. Stacking the record as a fourth component \
",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "04646437-faee-7dfc-2c1c-7e70fe9b47c6"],
 ", the integrated homodyne signal, the state and its readout form one It\
\[OHat] SDE, a drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1cbde497-e826-5557-4442-fdd089d33fbd"],
 " times ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "t"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ecb37d0-fbcc-3e82-16c8-ae9dfe7e84e8"],
 " plus a diffusion ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4c358d3e-86d3-ec5f-75ca-25783367b6a5"],
 " times one scalar increment ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], "(", GridBox[{
      {
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["y", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["z", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}
     }], ")", "=", 
    UnderscriptBox[
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
            StyleBox["eff",
             FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
            StyleBox["eff",
             FontSlant->"Plain"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"], "-", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
            StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{
           SubscriptBox[
            StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
           StyleBox["(",
            SpanMaxSize->1], 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
           StyleBox[")",
            SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
            StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]}
        }], ")"}], "\[UnderBrace]"], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", "+", "\[ThickSpace]", 
    UnderscriptBox[
     UnderscriptBox[
      RowBox[{"(", GridBox[{
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"], "-", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{"-", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["z", "TI"], "+", 
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["x", "TI"]}]},
         {
          RowBox[{
           SqrtBox[
            SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
             StyleBox[
              RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
           StyleBox["(",
            SpanMaxSize->1], 
           RowBox[{"1", "-", 
            SuperscriptBox[
             StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
           StyleBox[")",
            SpanMaxSize->1]}]},
         {"1"}
        }], ")"}], "\[UnderBrace]"], 
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"110914de-bbdd-83a1-4736-8d983e69d18b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The fourth row is the record ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "76d004f9-29e5-6665-1eef-9da34f904d4f"],
 ": its drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2c76c797-c249-79ca-540d-ded0f7fc4b10"],
 " carries the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "35077f55-9291-6519-633d-771f27244c63"],
 " signal and its noise is the same ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],
 ". The top three rows, the Bloch state, close on their own (nothing depends \
on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],
 "), so the code below encodes that state block and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["Q", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],
 " is a passive integral we can reconstruct from a trajectory and its noise."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Every parameter is a rate, in the units where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],
 ": ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"],
 " is the informative (coherent-information) rate, which sharpens the state \
toward a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Sigma]", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],
 " eigenstate; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfe104a-50de-a555-0985-8a1461680fbf"],
 " is the backaction rate of the orthogonal quadrature, which only kicks the \
phase; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "134534fb-1061-d656-417a-ada5a115bcbc"],
 " is the measurement-induced dephasing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["m", "TI"]], "/", "2"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2cd98fd2-34e7-e188-54e6-269cbc93b3d2"],
 "; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"],
 " is the intrinsic pure dephasing; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "=", "1", "/", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T", "TI"], "1"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "608e87cc-8fce-afdf-10b5-1e962a78f525"],
 " is the relaxation rate; and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
   StyleBox["x", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2aa912c6-4938-1bb7-5a56-8ba068cd699d"],
 " is the Rabi frequency. Two combinations recur: the transverse decay ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
    StyleBox["eff",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "=", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], "/", "2", "+", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], "+", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], "=", "1", "/", 
   SubsuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["T", "TI"], "2", 
    StyleBox["eff",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "66b4bee0-d247-b105-0e4b-37cde7f3006f"],
 ", and the detector efficiency ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"2", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "337c2d89-644e-5b5e-6103-c4d30dfb29a4"],
 ", with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"0", "\[LessEqual]", 
   StyleBox["\[Eta]", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7c2741-1c81-ec9b-0503-bf2b9535b6e1"],
 ", which we set to one (optimal homodyne phase) throughout. The ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "t"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "644cc522-c7c4-9b18-0c73-dc8ff276e662"],
 " column of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],
 " is the Lindblad flow and the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6801f052-da94-0b6f-183e-ea1fdf2159b5"],
 " column of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0daf8e98-7628-e40b-3b54-27c203c2cf51"],
 " is the measurement backaction."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "For a single scalar noise, the It\[OHat] equation above is the ",
 StyleBox["same process", "TI"],
 " as a Stratonovich equation with the same diffusion and a drift lowered by \
one term (this is the It\[OHat]-Stratonovich conversion, unambiguous for \
scalar noise, with no Levy-area subtlety):"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], "(", GridBox[{
      {
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["y", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["z", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}
     }], ")", "=", 
    StyleBox["(",
     FontSize->1.8 Inherited], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "-", 
    FractionBox["1", "2"], 
    StyleBox["(",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    RowBox[{
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[CenterDot]", "\[Del]"}], 
    StyleBox[")",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox[")",
     FontSize->1.8 Inherited], " ", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", "+", "\[ThickSpace]", 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[SmallCircle]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"],

Cell["which becomes:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], "(", GridBox[{
      {
       StyleBox["x", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["y", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["z", "TI"]},
      {
       StyleBox["Q", "TI"]}
     }], ")", "=", "(", GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["(",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], "2"], "-", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
         StyleBox["eff",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
         StyleBox[
          RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], "-", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        StyleBox["(",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
        FractionBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], "+", 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], "2"], "-", 
        SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
         StyleBox["eff",
          FontSlant->"Plain"]], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
         StyleBox[
          RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
        SuperscriptBox[
         StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"], 
        StyleBox[")",
         FontSize->1.2 Inherited], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         RowBox[{
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], 
          SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
           StyleBox[
            RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}]], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], "-", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
         StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         StyleBox["z", "TI"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
         StyleBox[
          RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
        SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
         StyleBox["x", "TI"]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"]}]}
     }], ")", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], "\[ThickSpace]", "+", "\[ThickSpace]", "(", 
    GridBox[{
      {
       RowBox[{"-", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], "-", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{"-", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["y", "TI"], 
        StyleBox["z", "TI"], "+", 
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["x", "TI"]}]},
      {
       RowBox[{
        SqrtBox[
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
          StyleBox[
           RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
        StyleBox["(",
         SpanMaxSize->1], 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"]}], 
        StyleBox[")",
         SpanMaxSize->1]}]},
      {"1"}
     }], ")", "\[SmallCircle]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["W", "TI"]}], "."}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",ExpressionUUID->"3b7fe4cc-5889-7f4e-6904-fd96593c4594"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In short, writing the correction as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[Congruent]", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[CenterDot]", "\[Del]"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6cb5c01f-62f5-68e0-144a-da5916803aca"],
 ", the Stratonovich drift is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "-", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "55f417ec-7166-d78d-038b-8eb60010bdd7"],
 " component by component, while the diffusion ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "4b6e5dad-9702-0c1f-7916-54f722b75765"],
 " is untouched, now read as a Stratonovich product ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[SmallCircle]", " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1d359769-845f-cd94-44ca-0f332deb97fe"],
 ". The readout is the same in both forms, because its noise is additive, so \
only the state equation carries the correction. This is the whole reason the \
document exists: a smooth noise integrates to the Stratonovich equation, so \
to solve the It\[OHat] equation we will hand ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2055bfee-d4b5-7aa2-506a-36cbdd404888"],
 " the drift ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "-", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "64c30c0d-1857-1b13-0cf0-a65799e26679"],
 ", and the smoothing puts ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "46632a09-cc5f-b0ef-6e10-cc52e5eb0235"],
 " back. We will compute ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ea251ed-865f-e03c-1652-48b733ebb306"],
 " symbolically below. Let's start."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"25a0bfbe-b1d4-2428-535f-36fbc0668f72"],

Cell["Encoding the drift and the diffusion", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"04786d0e-016a-d127-2c07-8568b01ca00d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Encode the state drift, the top three rows of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d15b43a-cd49-5244-5b2a-2e67e4fc20ae"],
 ", reading the rate vector positionally as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]}], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"B", "A"}], "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
     StyleBox["x", "TI"]], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2d1ff276-b82a-c3ca-5b24-f43039dc9110"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"14fd1512-f616-8834-3c82-8d5f83a0db1e"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "driftV", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"driftV", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r_"}],
     "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]2", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalGamma]2"}], " ", "x"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalGamma]2"}], " ", "y"}], " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "z"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", "z"}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "y"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"66c67103-72a1-9427-0efe-696d0755ff0d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Encode the state diffusion, the top three rows of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "48c794f4-84f6-2bfc-78fc-0dbe2c8379c6"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"58ee7ecb-1370-1005-0896-7795a605636f"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "diffV", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x_", ",", " ", "y_", ",", " ", "z_"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r_"}],
     "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "x", " ", "z"}], " ", 
      "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "y"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "y", " ", "z"}], " ", 
      "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
        RowBox[{"r", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", "x"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
       RowBox[{"r", "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "}"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"11d04a92-cbef-a8a5-47e0-63dfed9bfa8f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Fix a representative dispersive transmon, rescaled by ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7d9821c9-0e61-bc6d-2ba7-b893ab1506b7"],
 ", from a ground-state start over a short window:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3181a460-bc62-f1ee-67be-3e4a3514c334"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ratesB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
    "0.352", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.176", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", 
     "1.", ",", " ", "3."}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"initB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "1."}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"tfB", " ", "=", " ", "3."}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"nB", " ", "=", " ", "600"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"3937e1d4-04c3-e55a-68cc-f89ead77cfa0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The exact reference for the mean is the Lindblad master equation, which for \
this affine drift closes in a ",
 Cell[BoxData["DSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b45e796-37a7-eecc-197a-fed04253b416"],
 " form with no integration error. Define it as a function returning ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e187950-8ca2-2ab2-0638-711a25577898"],
 ", its third component the mean ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], "\[VeryThinSpace]", 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "250a2d7c-9b81-05b0-5309-c5261e346f9a"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"15a9104d-5625-6af3-4356-8a1763d038d9"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "lindbladBloch", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x0_", ",", " ", "y0_", ",", " ", "z0_"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], " ", 
   ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]2", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"r", "[", 
           RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
         RowBox[{"r", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", "sol", ",", " ", "xf",
        ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"sol", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"DSolve", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"xf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalGamma]2"}], " ", 
              RowBox[{"xf", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"yf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"-", "\[CapitalGamma]2"}], " ", 
               RowBox[{"yf", "[", "t", "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
               RowBox[{"zf", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}]}], ",", "\n", "       ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"zf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"zf", "[", "t", "]"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"r", "[", 
                RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
               RowBox[{"yf", "[", "t", "]"}]}]}]}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"xf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "x0"}], ",", " ", 
            
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"yf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "y0"}], ",", " ", 
            
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"zf", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "z0"}]}], "}"}], ",",
           "\n", "      ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"xf", ",", " ", "yf", ",", " ", "zf"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          "t"}], "]"}], " ", "//", " ", "First"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{"tt", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xf", "[", "tt", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"yf", "[", "tt", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"zf", "[", "tt", "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", "/.", " ", "sol"}], 
         "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"58c17d8b-1b7e-6f79-08ff-74d59e0b3243"],

Cell["\<\
The random ODE: turning a Wiener path into a forcing NDSolve can eat\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"43821c38-6720-b4f9-71b1-966212da1ec3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A white-noise increment ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox[
   RowBox[{"d", "W"}], "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "341c54d9-3079-6bba-5c24-4d83410c3980"],
 " is not a function of time, it is a distribution, and ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1dbf9c2b-d84a-d79b-4b44-1674d9fcbde1"],
 " cannot integrate a distribution. But if we draw the noise on a grid and \
connect the dots into a smooth curve ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0f449897-1a0e-51e7-357b-11d19fbb23cd"],
 ", then ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6d5a63ab-93b9-14f3-1b7a-7af5264c7ed9"],
 " is an ordinary function, and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "=", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "+", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], " ", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["W", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5077c06e-c394-b43c-000c-da4bf6261f06"],
 " becomes the ordinary differential equation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "."], "=", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], " ", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07359582-e823-44a1-2eca-0cef89d62e8b"],
 ". In other words, we replace white noise by a smooth approximation with a \
short but finite correlation time."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c239bd0-3ff5-3b18-25d0-129ab9818662"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Define a function that draws Gaussian increments on a grid of spacing ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "68c76573-72ce-0c1a-18fd-7d3d077b5760"],
 ", accumulates them into a Wiener path, and interpolates with a cubic so the \
result is twice differentiable:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6184d2f2-049e-728e-17bb-cbbcad2b40d4"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "wienerFun", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
    RowBox[{"tf_", ",", " ", "dtGen_", ",", " ", "seed_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "seed", "]"}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"grid", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dtGen"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
         " ", "incr"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"incr", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"RandomVariate", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"NormalDistribution", "[", 
            RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "dtGen", "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Length", "[", "grid", "]"}], " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], 
          "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"Interpolation", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"grid", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"Accumulate", "[", "incr", "]"}], ",", " ", "0."}], 
              "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"InterpolationOrder", " ", "->", " ", "3"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
      "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"4fd967ef-5008-0b29-75e7-7ec961bd5673"],

Cell["\<\
Visualize one realization of the path and its derivative, the smooth stand-in \
for white noise:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"19bb1c5e-57ab-6e36-4f58-9618625e351c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
      RowBox[{"tfB", ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"tfB", "/", "300"}], ",", " ", "11"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
   "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"GraphicsRow", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Wf", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", 
         "    ", 
         RowBox[{
         "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<regularized Wiener path W(t)\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<W\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Wf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", 
         "    ", 
         RowBox[{
         "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
          " ", "\"\<its derivative W'(t): the smooth noise\>\""}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<W'\>\""}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "620"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[6]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"5c8dcc56-7aa9-964a-04b2-e6107f5dfc90"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["W", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30baa1c8-66ad-75e0-6059-389213585fca"],
 " is a continuous random walk and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "52535901-cb26-8b9c-0261-516aeed0d9e6"],
 " is a jagged but genuine function, varying on the scale ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "323a4b1c-b138-a791-63da-6359c0b20dfb"],
 ". Recall from the two forms above that this smoothing lands on the \
Stratonovich reading, so the drift we must feed ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7421cf44-a1ac-4319-1dde-e721d0592e63"],
 " is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "-", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "511b3347-8d7d-ab60-0738-ab212409f64a"],
 ". To get ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "36c19c85-764d-0b01-5efe-15ef03f8566b"],
 " in closed form, write the six rates as symbols:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6815cd54-0cd7-196f-182a-e51ea5626bb5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ratesSym", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<BA\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<d\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<\[Phi]\>\""}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
     "   ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], 
  ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"519775d4-d545-25f2-07ad-6c91dcf18fd8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Compute the correction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[CenterDot]", "\[Del]"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5900aac7-5263-773e-0f3f-43a167165a04"],
 ", as half the Jacobian of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06ecfdb3-2197-c9b0-2e93-f4fd50239b9a"],
 " contracted with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "12d95fcb-3316-2212-42e7-569546a37178"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"733995c2-f5bf-78ee-22c6-0caffc4a4a34"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"corrGeneral", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"With", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
    
    RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Grad", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
          RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "v"}], "]"}], 
       " ", ".", " ", 
       RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
        RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", "ratesSym"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"4f8ab258-7e7f-0723-7589-34027b0a6a09"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, this is the correction ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b12ee74-9953-131d-1921-003e18e67e67"],
 " on the three state rows (its record row is zero); reading its third \
component, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "=", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"], "-", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "65262d3c-fccc-1dc6-0cdd-c579f579672c"],
 ", it is a cubic in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5e157ee2-48da-d240-062b-77cc696ca0aa"],
 " set by the informative rate. Turn it into a fast pure function of a Bloch \
point, so we can subtract it inside the solver:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"78287f93-0f12-7c52-2828-76ddaaa746b8"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "corrFn", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"corrFn", "[", "r_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
         "\[FormalA]", ",", " ", "\[FormalB]", ",", " ", "\[FormalC]"}], 
         "}"}]}], ",", " ", "c"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"c", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}], ")"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Grad", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
            RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "v"}], "]"}], " ", 
         ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
          RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"X", ",", " ", "Y", ",", " ", "Z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Evaluate", "[", 
         RowBox[{"c", " ", "/.", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Thread", "[", 
           RowBox[{"v", " ", "->", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"X", ",", " ", "Y", ",", " ", "Z"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
         "]"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[9]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"08285353-0e0e-39f8-3828-4b1dabb88bc2"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Assemble one trajectory: build a smooth noise, subtract the correction from \
the drift, and hand the random ODE to ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1daed7d3-93e8-7698-4b55-ce9d259d5ce2"],
 " with its step held below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "187adc3d-3961-76c2-4819-d667b8145c28"],
 " so it resolves the wiggles of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["W", "TI"], "\[Prime]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "641c78eb-7f03-7846-0c24-71b57ab64aac"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5bfcc75d-c21d-6fb0-0983-df06f7a8359a"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "oneTraj", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dtGen_", ",", " ", 
     "seed_", ",", " ", "maxstep_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "Wf", ",", " ", "cF", ",", " ", "xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz", ",",
        " ", "t", ",", " ", "rhs", ",", " ", "eqs"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Wf", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"wienerFun", "[", 
        RowBox[{"tf", ",", " ", "dtGen", ",", " ", "seed"}], "]"}]}], ";", 
      "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"cF", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"corrFn", "[", "r", "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"rhs", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"driftV", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xx", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"yy", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"zz", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], 
        " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"cF", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"xx", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"yy", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"zz", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "+", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"xx", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"yy", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"zz", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Wf", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"eqs", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "#2"}], 
            " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz"}], "}"}], ",", " ",
              "rhs"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xx", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"yy", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"zz", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
       RowBox[{"eqs", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tf"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"MaxStepSize", " ", "->", " ", "maxstep"}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[10]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"112ae6ec-4b5c-6ad2-4729-ffb66ee93838"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Show one trajectory's ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6121b9de-dddd-aca8-10de-309bd469f6f2"],
 " against the exact Lindblad mean, building the reference curve once in the ",
 Cell[BoxData["With"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "30209679-023a-ee91-61df-0823b7ccb4fb"],
 " so the plot variable stays out of its solver:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"29bc1606-c22d-409d-5f43-8863f7d812e7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"traj", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"tfB", "/", "300"}], ",", " ", "7", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"tfB", "/", "1200"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"lb", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
       RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"traj", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"lb", "[", "t", "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tfB"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"97", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Thick", ",", " ", "Black"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", 
     "  ", 
     RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<one smoothed trajectory z(t)\>\"", ",", 
        " ", "\"\<Lindblad <z>(t)\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"\"\<t\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<z\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{
     "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
      " ", "\"\<a single regularized-noise trajectory\>\""}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "480"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->
  "In[11]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"7bf1e1bf-5b3e-c64b-298e-f8f95ec8ac91"],

Cell["\<\
As expected, a single path does not track the mean; it fluctuates around it, \
because each measurement record pushes this particular qubit one way or the \
other. The mean lives in the ensemble, and the second moment in how widely \
the paths spread.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3119d855-3ffd-7401-6726-d21fb9885f6b"],

Cell["\<\
The invariants: the ball, the mean, and what the correction touches\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"62a6d1b5-4e36-fa69-125d-c8ff6bc0c8b3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The correction should be a pure measurement effect, with no trace of the \
drive or the dissipation. Confirm that ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7c41cdc9-5ab3-1ef5-247e-e4935f4664df"],
 " is free of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"], ",", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["\[Phi]", "TI"]], ",", 
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox["d", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "51fce014-dca1-0630-0783-fa51d5546d1a"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"657c1c65-980e-511d-1303-964f19bb2067"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"FreeQ", "[", 
  RowBox[{"corrGeneral", ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalOmega]", ",", " ", "\"\<x\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "|", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<1\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "|", "\n", 
    "   ", 
    RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[Gamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<\[Phi]\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "|", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<d\>\""}], "]"}]}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[12]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"0f15dbd5-5f35-596c-352a-d29f5ac02bb6"],

Cell["\<\
This confirms the It\[OHat]-Stratonovich gap is set entirely by the \
measurement rates, so it vanishes when there is nothing to measure. Take that \
no-measurement limit, both quadratures off:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e9b7e66-629a-1114-26b9-7040172f607e"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{"corrGeneral", " ", "/.", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "->", 
      " ", "0"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
       RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<BA\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "->", 
      " ", "0"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[13]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"585a51e6-774f-2dd2-087a-48c002fa7738"],

Cell["\<\
As expected, with no diffusion there is no calculus to reinterpret, so the \
correction is exactly zero. Note that turning off only the informative rate \
is not enough, because the phase backaction carries its own term:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1d7c0b5b-c40c-ea6a-4b03-a304edbeb8b0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{"corrGeneral", " ", "/.", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "->", 
    " ", "0"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[14]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"370294fd-9e49-2d35-5d31-0da71bfc741f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Now the ball ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["r", "TI"], "\[LessEqual]", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2845529c-454d-b13b-587b-4bc66cf90001"],
 ". Positivity of the qubit is exactly ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["r", "TI"], "=", 
   StyleBox["|",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]}], ",", 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "}"}], 
   StyleBox["|",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"\[LessEqual]", "1"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7519012f-e657-215b-2326-988893e273a1"],
 ", and the continuous flow respects it because the noise is tangent to the \
Bloch sphere. Show that the noise's radial component, the projection ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[CenterDot]", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "=", 
   SqrtBox[
    SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
     StyleBox[
      RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{"1", "-", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["r", "TI"], "2"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "594776df-9e75-d16a-0f7d-6f991b01a3b0"],
 ", vanishes on ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["r", "TI"], "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6405505f-4b92-3bd6-0c3b-4a196e24893c"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6878c7f8-419e-9db5-1807-dea27028e79f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"FullSimplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], " ", ".", " ", 
    RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      "ratesSym"}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
     RowBox[{"Subscript", "[", 
      RowBox[{"\[CapitalGamma]", ",", " ", "\"\<CI\>\""}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", 
    "z", " ", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"x", "^", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"y", "^", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"z", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[15]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"48a3d607-c312-9dd3-7850-c860f6a4e739"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "A bare zero: a noise step slides the state along the sphere and never off \
it. Finally the mean. The drift is affine in ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"]}], ",", 
   StyleBox["y", "TI"], ",", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["z", "TI"], "}"}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "539491e8-328f-8d7b-01ab-08b2473bd441"],
 ", so the ensemble mean obeys the Lindblad ODE exactly; the fingerprint of \
\"affine\" is a vanishing second derivative:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7fcf59b5-a5ca-2155-25f5-50fecc7f73bf"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", 
  RowBox[{"D", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"driftV", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
      "ratesSym"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"x", ",", " ", "y", ",", " ", "z"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "2"}], 
     "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[16]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"023f49e2-a747-9723-33c5-60cfd2f3fa09"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "An all-zero Hessian, so ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "/", 
   StyleBox["d", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["t", "TI"], "=", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["v", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "21aa1c49-e16c-f406-57a9-9612901edf6c"],
 " and matching the mean is only a weak test. The measurement backaction \
lives in the second moment, which we check next."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"289b85cd-827f-9a9c-58b8-1c97370be8e6"],

Cell["The ensemble: matching the mean and the second moment", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"12f3dbee-abc4-6375-4280-d2cbce714e5f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "We compare the corrected route against two references: the exact Lindblad \
mean, and the native ",
 Cell[BoxData["ItoProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "7ed5da6f-a344-b859-26ea-dc48d6f60aa3"],
 " route integrated by the SDE-native scalar-noise stochastic Runge-Kutta. \
The Lindblad line is the exact yardstick for the mean; the native route is an \
independent yardstick for the spread, built on different machinery, so \
agreement between them is meaningful."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2cfa2c34-ef50-7d46-5499-c6718ae547ac"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Define the native It\[OHat] reference, returning the final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "362a4e41-4988-041f-5e2a-602b683d6f65"],
 " of each path:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"01ed6b92-5a5f-fa78-3792-82dc5febc942"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "itoZfinal", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"itoZfinal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"x0_", ",", " ", "y0_", ",", " ", "z0_"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     "tf_", ",", " ", "dt_", ",", " ", "ntraj_", ",", " ", "seed_"}], "]"}], 
   " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"proc", ",", " ", "td"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"proc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"ItoProcess", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"driftV", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"\[FormalX]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"\[FormalY]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"\[FormalZ]", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
             "r"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"List", " ", "/@", " ", 
            RowBox[{"diffV", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"\[FormalX]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"\[FormalY]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"\[FormalZ]", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
              "r"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"\[FormalX]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[FormalY]", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"\[FormalZ]", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", 
         "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
            "\[FormalX]", ",", " ", "\[FormalY]", ",", " ", "\[FormalZ]"}], 
            "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"x0", ",", " ", "y0", ",", " ", "z0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",",
          " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"td", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"BlockRandom", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"SeedRandom", "[", "seed", "]"}], ";", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"RandomFunction", "[", 
          RowBox[{"proc", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dt"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           "ntraj", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
           "Method", " ", "->", 
            " ", "\"\<StochasticRungeKuttaScalarNoise\>\""}]}], "]"}]}], 
        "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"td", "[", "\"\<ValueList\>\"", "]"}], ")"}], "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", 
        RowBox[{"All", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"-", "1"}], ",", " ", "3"}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[17]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"107fa29c-d013-1000-4004-3bd9e1a6636a"],

Cell["Start the worker kernels:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6798df62-4cc7-e4e1-0da7-d74c6573cecb"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"LaunchKernels", "[", "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[18]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"49f5450b-e8d1-97dd-7f8b-5d548965fd27"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Share the definitions with them, so ",
 Cell[BoxData["ParallelTable"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2570a8a5-7a6f-59e7-530f-410f7f1a2bcd"],
 " can spread the trajectories across cores:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0b990c23-b656-01a6-39a6-a58cc3e3538c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"DistributeDefinitions", "[", 
  RowBox[{
  "driftV", ",", " ", "diffV", ",", " ", "corrFn", ",", " ", "wienerFun", ",",
    " ", "oneTraj"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[19]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"52243646-2fbd-210e-03db-a8204a487054"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Define the ensemble as many corrected trajectories on independent noise (a \
per-index seed), returning each path's final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1acd7f4d-3da3-7753-4af3-7717b4565db9"],
 " and its largest Bloch radius:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"062d91f0-6326-41c0-2fd2-08ba16d3132a"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "ensemble", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ensemble", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "dtGen_", ",", " ", 
     "ntraj_", ",", " ", "baseSeed_", ",", " ", "maxstep_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=",
    "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"Transpose", "@", 
    RowBox[{"ParallelTable", "[", "\n", "    ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"tr", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"oneTraj", "[", 
           RowBox[{
           "r", ",", " ", "init", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "dtGen", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"baseSeed", " ", "+", " ", "i"}], ",", " ", "maxstep"}], 
           "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"tr", "[", 
            RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], "[", "tf", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
              RowBox[{"Through", "[", 
               RowBox[{"tr", "[", "s", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", 
               RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
                RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "100"}], "]"}]}], 
              "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"i", ",", " ", "ntraj"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",\

 CellLabel->
  "In[20]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"1ac7f74a-ce09-be58-4afc-ef17ebbd04a2"],

Cell["Run the native reference on the weak-readout case:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6f6ad260-8ee1-565a-1569-d44a2a943ca0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"itoB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"itoZfinal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"tfB", "/", "600"}], ",", " ", "nB", ",", " ", "2024"}], "]"}]}],
   ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[21]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"612fd791-c81e-86f2-10d4-cedae9a8ecd8"],

Cell["Run the corrected ensemble on the same case:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"26dca2d1-2715-746d-4ee3-3b9b52a05eb7"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"corB", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ensemble", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB", ",", " ", "tfB", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"tfB", "/", "300"}], ",", " ", "nB", ",", " ", "9100", ",", " ", 
     
     RowBox[{"tfB", "/", "1200"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[22]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"296a77cd-8fa3-dd44-5f6a-6e972a57a7ae"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Compare the mean of the final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],
 ", in order exact Lindblad, native It\[OHat], corrected smoothed:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"25b5b884-ef74-61b3-534a-31e18a013399"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ratesB", ",", " ", "initB"}], "]"}], "[", "tfB", "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "itoB", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Mean", "[", 
    RowBox[{"corB", "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[23]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"574a2197-51ef-7938-7d49-b8d1679a4802"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, the corrected mean lands on the exact Lindblad value, \
within the Monte-Carlo scatter ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"1", "/", 
   SqrtBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e85e9ed-427b-8528-16ba-00b7770fec72"],
 " shared by both ensembles. That certifies the drift; now the noise. Compare \
the standard deviation of the final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73b76025-96bb-3fff-214d-798f234f85c5"],
 ", native It\[OHat] against corrected smoothed:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"31f4c073-8ff6-126f-678b-da3d298360b5"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "itoB", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", 
    RowBox[{"corB", "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[24]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"72ff7667-e560-b2c0-2285-68408c1a002a"],

Cell["\<\
As expected, the two spreads agree, so the noise term is right, not just the \
drift. Read the largest Bloch radius any corrected path reached:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7c9be80e-0554-61c1-24b8-0268ace1332b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
  RowBox[{"corB", "[", 
   RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[25]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"106b7ad8-6378-599b-4069-7382160d2be1"],

Cell["\<\
The radius sits at one to within a hair, the same tiny overshoot the native \
stochastic Runge-Kutta shows, and no projection step was needed to hold it.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7e6f7c7a-fa8f-2da1-2615-7627ff3a778b"],

Cell["\<\
The correction scales with the measurement rate, so a strong readout is the \
stringent test. Fix a strong informative readout from a tilted start:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"304452a4-201b-d64c-607c-4b0e51afbc96"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ratesS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
    "8.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "4.", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", "1.", ",",
      " ", "3."}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"initS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"0.6", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.6"}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"tfS", " ", "=", " ", "1.5"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"nS", " ", "=", " ", "600"}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[26]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6beff1f8-c64a-83a6-1994-e8a5f3fcd18c"],

Cell["Run the native reference for the strong case:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4b5b9263-9199-4e16-7978-144d202c157c"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"itoS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"itoZfinal", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesS", ",", " ", "initS", ",", " ", "tfS", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"tfS", "/", "1200"}], ",", " ", "nS", ",", " ", "3030"}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[27]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"475d7054-346c-a3cc-6d63-6a1ebd1ef116"],

Cell["Run the corrected ensemble for the strong case:", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2ef71510-aa09-eca9-568c-8d5dcfbdb6f3"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"corS", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ensemble", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesS", ",", " ", "initS", ",", " ", "tfS", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"tfS", "/", "400"}], ",", " ", "nS", ",", " ", "5300", ",", " ", 
     
     RowBox[{"tfS", "/", "1600"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[28]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"3343f580-98d5-e31c-6170-ecea1961ce66"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Compare the mean of the final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "20a7420b-376a-b23f-505d-6455421c0105"],
 ", in order exact Lindblad, native It\[OHat], corrected smoothed:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"6af863a9-1098-c609-1a98-7af3a112ad53"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
      RowBox[{"ratesS", ",", " ", "initS"}], "]"}], "[", "tfS", "]"}], "[", 
    RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "itoS", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Mean", "[", 
    RowBox[{"corS", "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[29]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"055bc2ad-6b92-a3be-3378-dbf70e24f184"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, the corrected mean still tracks the exact value where the \
correction is large. See the whole distribution agree, the corrected final-",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2b0fb60e-2211-365f-5934-286857a59ca5"],
 " histogram against the native It\[OHat] reference:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"201a2509-bdd9-2fa1-5039-bd53346c758b"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Histogram", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"corS", "[", 
      RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "itoS"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   "24", ",", " ", "\"\<PDF\>\"", ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ChartLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<corrected smoothed\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Ito ref\>\""}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<final z\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<density\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", 
   "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
    " ", "\"\<strong readout: corrected route matches the Ito ensemble\>\""}],
    ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"ImageSize", " ", "->", " ", "520"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[30]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"7085d256-6adc-aa08-20ba-d4100f6ef952"],

Cell["\<\
As one can see, the corrected distribution sits on top of the native \
It\[OHat] reference, so the route reproduces the ensemble, not merely its \
average.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f932952-49a5-d34f-05a0-c11c6851a195"],

Cell["The two time steps: which one sets the answer", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"160f17c4-d31a-fe19-3e34-8ea1e6acc563"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "There are two time increments, and they do not play symmetric roles. The \
first, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "10beb8bd-bdb6-ee93-4045-31e73440b4f9"],
 ", is the grid the Wiener increments are drawn on; it sets the correlation \
time of the regularized noise and is the dial that fixes which SDE we solve, \
converging to it as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]], "\[Rule]", "0"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3fdc991b-fead-14b0-65e3-1144fb587e9a"],
 ". The second, the ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3657d2c5-05c0-ac85-5e6c-cbafac7af6ef"],
 " step ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0642d375-09f3-9942-2e71-cb3faf87eba8"],
 ", only has to resolve the smooth forcing between noise knots, so it must \
sit below ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0651775d-2bad-791b-2e6f-6f074e584861"],
 ", or the solver steps over the wiggles and integrates a noise we never \
generated. In short, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63b9e3d6-2298-231e-1146-fa9057128e64"],
 " is the accuracy dial and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "67c13665-f813-2f11-0dfe-a84ef9a6727b"],
 " is the SDE-limit dial, sent to zero in that order."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4c440104-ea8a-4285-747b-99618f3f10ef"],

Cell["\<\
Read the native reference the sweep should approach, mean then spread:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"66c9a615-af45-c085-0ef6-385ecaf192ef"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"{", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "itoS", "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "itoS", "]"}]}], "}"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[31]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"0513e607-0f4c-1e20-3320-f861aaf9650a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Halve ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0371ff35-cd30-cda2-310e-f77ee4ca9788"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["h", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6833ae6a-6ac5-a2c8-19c0-40340f71f012"],
 " held below it, and tabulate the corrected mean and spread against it, as \
step, mean, spread:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5f7f2999-1aee-25a5-0504-c0c39e988f8f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"With", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"z", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"First", "@", 
            RowBox[{"ensemble", "[", 
             RowBox[{"ratesS", ",", " ", "initS", ",", " ", "tfS", ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"tfS", "/", "k"}], ",", " ", "500", ",", " ", "6000", ",",
               " ", 
              RowBox[{"tfS", "/", 
               RowBox[{"(", 
                RowBox[{"4", " ", "k"}], ")"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
         "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"N", "[", 
            RowBox[{"tfS", "/", "k"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Mean", "[", "z", "]"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"StandardDeviation", "[", "z", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"100", ",", " ", "200", ",", " ", "400"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}],
       "]"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<dtGen\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<corrected mean\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<corrected std\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[32]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"128c7526-c883-085d-42b4-6c83e9365aa7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, the corrected mean and spread are stable as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[CapitalDelta]", 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["gen",
     FontSlant->"Plain"]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3279c00f-c9e2-8758-6206-da68ef94eda2"],
 " shrinks and sit at the native values, so the answer has converged in the \
SDE-limit dial and is not an artifact of the step."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"50b12ff8-e606-85f7-004e-c6a593b0efdd"],

Cell["Performance: where regularizing pays for itself", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"640f47a5-4648-c62d-0c35-5e0f73e2ad77"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Per trajectory this route costs more than the native ",
 Cell[BoxData["ItoProcess"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "63a48922-0fac-666c-115b-208caa594cb6"],
 ", which integrates the whole ensemble in one vectorized call, so on a \
gentle problem the native route wins and the corrected smoothed route earns \
its keep as an independent cross-check. The place it wins outright is the \
stiff regime, where the companion's explicit scheme broke: Euler-Maruyama \
treats the fast Rabi rotation explicitly, so it is stable only above a step \
count ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["n", "TI"], "*"], "=", 
   SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalOmega]", 
    StyleBox["x", "TI"], "2"], 
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["f", "TI"]], "/", 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SubsuperscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", "2", 
     StyleBox["eff",
      FontSlant->"Plain"]], "+", 
    SubscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "1"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "387a9e0d-0234-0e73-6819-1057b7c15559"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3f64ca0d-9927-5f44-651b-ec5718d225ae"],

Cell["\<\
Turn the measurement off, so the single path is deterministic and the exact \
answer is available, and push the drive to the true transmon strength:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"399d1ff3-4632-be92-6fa2-96bd73c404f8"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ratesF", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
    "0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", "1.", ",",
      " ", 
     RowBox[{"60", " ", "Pi"}]}], "}"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"initF", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"N", "[", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Sin", "[", "0.001", "]"}], ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Cos", "[", "0.001", "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"tfF", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"1.", "/", "3"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[33]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"1170384d-2f38-2c50-470f-b2174acd76ba"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Read the exact final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ce33075-6d34-44a7-1490-aa3f04c12e8d"],
 " this deterministic path must reach:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"54e2b6d5-0ba4-5b19-7c91-2f9fae512663"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lindbladBloch", "[", 
    RowBox[{"ratesF", ",", " ", "initF"}], "]"}], "[", "tfF", "]"}], "[", 
  RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[34]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"6334ac9c-43f1-85c0-12cb-45c67585ef2a"],

Cell["\<\
Compute the explicit-Euler stability threshold, the step count below which \
the fast rotation is amplified rather than resolved:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"74397683-04f4-1d4d-1dc7-6fedac816797"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"nStar", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ratesF", "[", 
     RowBox[{"[", "6", "]"}], "]"}], "^", "2"}], " ", 
   RowBox[{"tfF", "/", 
    RowBox[{"(", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"(", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"ratesF", "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ratesF", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "4", "]"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ratesF", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"ratesF", "[", 
       RowBox[{"[", "5", "]"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[35]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"735e49d5-32a1-4a48-2166-609f47541892"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Define the bare forward-Euler update, returning the final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "335d55a2-cf9b-493d-6163-4c0fea2e1807"],
 " and the largest radius:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3bfbbd45-edb8-1b0b-6998-352e844d6651"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "emDet", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"emDet", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "nsteps_"}], 
    "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"dt", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"tf", "/", "nsteps"}]}], ",", " ", "path"}], "}"}], ",", "\n",
      "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"path", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"NestList", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"#", " ", "+", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"driftV", "[", 
              RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "r"}], "]"}], " ", "dt"}]}], ")"}], " ", 
          "&"}], ",", " ", "init", ",", " ", "nsteps"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<z(tf)\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Last", "[", "path", "]"}], "[", 
          RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<max r\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Norm", " ", "/@", " ", "path"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[36]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"045023ab-c37d-b770-2c6f-baf4f6091a5a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Sweep the step count across ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], "*"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "73e8aeff-5b91-f8f4-2197-47b95e25cade"],
 ", tabulated as steps, final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "33e490f1-5bc8-e939-619b-09bb5e62b803"],
 ", largest radius:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"794a4309-908b-2549-2f4a-5b53213f8f93"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Sequence", " ", "@@", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Values", "[", 
           RowBox[{"emDet", "[", 
            RowBox[{
            "ratesF", ",", " ", "initF", ",", " ", "tfF", ",", " ", "#"}], 
            "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"1000", ",", " ", "4000", ",", " ", "8000"}], "}"}]}], ",", 
     "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<nSteps\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<EM z(tf)\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<EM max r\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[37]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"167ebcf0-2b32-2a61-3e05-35ba4ec7794b"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "As one can see, at a thousand steps Euler-Maruyama has blown past the ball \
entirely, and only well above ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["n", "TI"], "*"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "15eb24b6-b946-3a65-43e8-bdf038f0894f"],
 " does it become bounded, and even then it is still off the exact value, \
because it is only first order. Define the smoothed route with the \
measurement off, which is simply ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "27d2a24c-1e84-19ee-4de1-44169b316b34"],
 " on the drift, returning the final ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["z", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "285985c7-a1c8-13eb-5866-1ca0d07d6131"],
 ", the largest radius, and the number of steps it took:"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"57868ed1-450c-c474-7dbd-279b6cbeaf5e"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", "ndDet", "]"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"ndDet", "[", 
    RowBox[{"r_", ",", " ", "init_", ",", " ", "tf_", ",", " ", "maxstep_"}], 
    "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
      "xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz", ",", " ", "t", ",", " ", "eqs", ",",
        " ", "sol", ",", " ", "gr"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"eqs", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Join", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"#1", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", "#2"}], 
            " ", "&"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"{", 
              RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"driftV", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"{", 
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"xx", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"yy", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"zz", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "r"}], 
              "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"xx", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"yy", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"zz", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
            RowBox[{"init", "[", 
             RowBox[{"[", "3", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"sol", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"NDSolve", "[", 
         RowBox[{"eqs", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"xx", ",", " ", "yy", ",", " ", "zz"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "tf"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"MaxStepSize", " ", "->", " ", "maxstep"}]}], "]"}], "[", 
        RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"gr", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Subdivide", "[", 
        RowBox[{"0.", ",", " ", "tf", ",", " ", "3000"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"\"\<z(tf)\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"zz", "[", "tf", "]"}], " ", "/.", " ", "sol"}], ")"}]}], ",",
         "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<max r\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"xx", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"yy", "[", "s", "]"}], ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"zz", "[", "s", "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", "/.", " ", 
              "sol"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "gr"}], "}"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
        "\n", "    ", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<NDSolve steps\>\"", " ", "->", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"xx", " ", "/.", " ", "sol"}], ")"}], "[", "\"\<Grid\>\"",
            "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[38]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"0c5e608e-35dc-f74f-3466-79e8bc6edd95"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Run it at a step capped at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox[
    StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["f", "TI"]], "/", "1000"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1a1e4090-3303-05ed-4a26-59da46b66f37"],
 ":"
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"10256af3-3972-af7a-41da-83bdb804f240"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"ndDet", "[", 
  RowBox[{"ratesF", ",", " ", "initF", ",", " ", "tfF", ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"tfF", "/", "1000"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[39]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"457602f1-d86e-ac86-730d-9bbad918f6ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The contrast is the whole point: ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "499f95c1-a958-6c18-7fa4-0caac8ed3762"],
 " reaches the exact answer to machine-level accuracy in about a thousand \
steps and stays in the ball, while Euler-Maruyama needs several times more \
just to avoid diverging. Decoupling the noise grid from the integration step \
frees us to use a stable, adaptive integrator on the drift, instead of being \
pinned to the explicit scheme's stability window."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"0f1e874b-6d22-b8ab-3525-1f1504d40af1"],

Cell["What is now true", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"0c02104f-9807-e6c4-3431-8a2919b3cc2e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The trajectory equation has two readings that differ by the single drift \
term ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "=", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"], "\[CenterDot]", "\[Del]"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["b", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6f909018-5ea1-6a32-15af-0a425b543918"],
 ", a pure measurement-backaction vector whose third component is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   SubscriptBox["\[CapitalGamma]", 
    StyleBox[
     RowBox[{"C", "I"}], "TI"]], " ", 
   StyleBox["z", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["z", "TI"], "2"], "-", "1"}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2f4595f3-090a-1216-557a-0cbda8bf617c"],
 ". A smooth noise integrates to the Stratonovich reading, so the correct way \
to put this SDE through ",
 Cell[BoxData["NDSolve"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "06385f5e-e9d4-4e6c-2fd8-571b886114b6"],
 " is to feed it the It\[OHat] drift minus ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "25d2fb85-296f-82e5-53e1-f2ef481bd0cf"],
 ": the smoothing adds ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  OverscriptBox[
   StyleBox["c", "TI"], "\[RightVector]"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "3b9a140e-d97a-4136-69b9-8e6bd80f101c"],
 " back, and the two cancel. With the term carried, the route reproduces the \
exact Lindblad mean, matches the native It\[OHat] route's second moment and \
full distribution in both weak and strong readout, and keeps the state in the \
Bloch ball to machine precision without any projection, because the noise was \
tangent all along. Of the two time increments, the noise-generation step is \
the dial that fixes the SDE limit and is sent to zero, while the integrator \
step merely sits below it to resolve the noise, and keeping them separate is \
what lets a stable adaptive integrator carry a stiff drive that the explicit \
Euler-Maruyama of the companion cannot."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"4f9438da-b80f-a114-75ab-b18439bbf07e"]
},
FrontEndVersion->"15.0 for Mac OS X ARM (64-bit) (February 17, 2026)",
